					<![CDATA[
						 <p>You hate Dr. Mann, don't you?<br /> And I totally think this was an awesome ending, even though I had to suspend exactly 60% of my disbelief to enjoy it.<br /> Dr. Gerald an O5&#8230; I believe he is an <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/scp-666-j">SCP</a>, isn't he? I understand that this wouldn't be a problem normally, considering O5-9, but what if he decides to make a use his phone to &quot;attend&quot; an O5 meeting while driving.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
