					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-407817#post-1545345</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-407817/annon#post-1545345</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Thu, 23 Aug 2012 12:06:11 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>MrBreaksIt</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1379550</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>A wonderful tale, Bright, old man! I simply loved the mix of quirkiness, gallows humour (&quot;O-5 soup&quot;) and just the right amount of grimmness. That is what the Foundation is all about to me, sir, well done and upvoted.</p> <p>In other news, O5-13 has officially entered my headcanon, but will be unavailable for interview until I've cleared out all the pop-culture refferences I've already built up around him.</p> <p>Mann is my favourite researcher, so I'm glad to see him, but I dislike the characterisation he was given here. Not very Mannly, if you ask me. I sort of mentally photoshopped him out and replaced him with Gray Mann from TF2 with a moustache.</p> <p>Other than that, a great tale and worthy of a thousand upvotes, jolly well done.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
